  lines:
  - "The procedure was a success. Your mutations have stabilized\u2026 "
  - Begin with basic movement. Use the W, A, S, D keys.
  - Each of you will have distinct abilities. To shift between yourselves, press
    1, 2, or 3. Press the space bar to activate your ability.
  - Additional data is logged in the lab report. Consult them for clarification,
    if needed.
  - You three will need time to adapt so we have prepared simulations to accelerate
    the process. Your first trial begins now. The chamber door on the right is locked.
    A switch lies within reach, if you work together to combine your abilities effectively.
    Fail, and the system will record it as weakness.
  selfWarpLength: 70
  dialogBox: {fileID: 0}
  dialogScript: {fileID: 0}
  triggerOnStartUp: 1
